Package: oran-dhcp-gen
Version: 2.2.3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6), python3-yaml
Maintainer: labuser
Description: O-RAN DHCP Configuration Generator
 Generates ISC DHCP and Kea DHCP configuration files from a YAML data model.
 .
 ISC target: dhcpd.conf, dhcpd6.conf, isc-dhcp-server
 Kea target: kea-dhcp4.conf, kea-dhcp6.conf
 .
 Features:
  - Single YAML source of truth for all O-RU DHCP settings
  - Reusable lease_profiles and ca_ra_profiles for DRY config
  - Per-class IPv4/IPv6 family enable/disable
  - Pool-scoped lease times that actually take effect in ISC DHCP
  - Spec-compliant O-RAN sub-option 0x86 byte (auto from class.protocol)
  - Multi-line ISC TLV emission for readability of long bootstrap chains
  - --deploy / --restart for safe in-place rollout
